{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","暗影打击"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","影の襲撃"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","闪现到敌方身边进行多段攻击。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","敵の近くに瞬間移動し、多段攻撃を行う"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","闪现到一名敌军身边，先对目标造成3次100% ATK伤害，之后短暂冻结目标并跳起再对目标造成150% + 20% ATK伤害，在此期间自身处于无敌状态，随后额外回复终极技能期间造成总伤害25%的生命值。优先选择最虚弱的敌军为目标。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","敵1体の近くに瞬間移動し、対象に100% ATKのダメージを3回与え、短時間の氷結を付与。その後、ジャンプして対象に150% + 20% ATKのダメージを与える。必殺技発動中、自身は無敵状態になる。その後、必殺技発動中の与ダメージ合計値×25%分のHPを回復。最も弱っている敵を優先的に対象に選択"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":50,"end":56,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":62,"end":68,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":46,"end":60,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":71,"end":73,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"},{"start":105,"end":109,"tooltip_key":"keyword:weakest"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":16,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":58,"end":72,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":92,"end":94,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"},{"start":131,"end":138,"tooltip_key":"keyword:weakest"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","跳起时对目标造成的伤害提升至160% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","ジャンプ時のダメージが160% + 20% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants